{
  // Low warm sun for animated-short daylight: one hard-working sun, long soft shadows, a cool sky fill and warm bounce from the ground.
  // No spot keys: faces are shaped by the sun itself, with the wrap and rim from "skin" and "sunRim" in the grade doing the soft part.
